  "solution": "Vì gia tốc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> của vật cùng hướng với lực <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> tác dụng lên vật nên góc tạo bởi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mover><mi>a</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>N</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.",
